# Pairs with NoAcknowledgedWriteLost. Only a genuine wait cycle may reach the timeout.
MODULE: SpuriousTimeout
TARGET: NoAcknowledgedWriteLost
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the call timeout fires on a link that is still making progress
PERTURBS: Timeout

--- FIND
    /\ seed \in {"blocked", "digestBlocked"}
    /\ lost' = TRUE
--- REPLACE
    \* MUTATION: the timeout fires on an admitted call
    /\ seed \in {"admitted", "blocked", "digestBlocked"}
    /\ lost' = TRUE
--- END
